{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive relentless waves of alien warbots as a customizable combat drone. Unlock weapons, deploy defensive towers mid-battle, and choose from 9 unique drone types in this fast-flowing roguelite arena shooter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique drones with unlockable weapons, abilities, and towers  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, wave-based arena shooter with tower-defense strategy  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller &amp; mouse support, Steam Achievements, Cloud Saves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works on Steam Deck and Rog Ally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly visuals and adjustable difficulty</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connect with us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord for dev chats, feedback, and future feature ideas! Follow us on X for patch news &amp; giveaways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 2352, humanity is exploring the exoplanets for the expansion of its stellar empire. It comes as no surprise that we encounter alien adversaries - some easy to conquer, others far more advanced and harder to subjugate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To assist in the conquest, a dedicated fleet of fighter drones called Compadrones - or 'compadre' drones were created to serve as the ultimate vanguard of our attack forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compadrone: Land wars is a family friendly top down roguelite arena shooter with elements of tower defense game play in which you play as a drone sent to fight off aliens on an exoplanet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to survive against hordes of invading aliens. Use an Xbox controller or mouse to maneuver your drone across an alien landscape while shooting alien warbots, gaining experience and collecting resources and powerups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841980/extras/4f6ca6c8b3baa76abdb04da16d8e4e95.avif?t=1755687922\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows you to choose between 9 different types of drones, and features multiple types of aliens. The weapons on your drone fire automatically when aliens come within their range. As you progress through the game, you gain XP that can be used to unlock more advanced drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841980/extras/f36d2d8c5229cd82c22b5d3e699e02fd.avif?t=1755687922\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy attacks come in waves, with each wave lasting between 1 to 3 minutes. At the end of each wave you can use the resources you have collected to unlock better weapons for the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841980/extras/2eed9e7ab5bd9129e29f74ba0d207d01.avif?t=1755687922\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, you can use the resources to buy and upgrade defensive towers during a wave. Defensive towers can be placed at strategic locations in the map to power up your fight against the aliens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be played either with a mouse or an X-box controller. For the best experience we recommend you use an X-box controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource points and XP are earned and spent whilst playing the game. There is no monetary value associated with these. These are merely constructs within the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no in-game purchases in this game.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The First 100","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841980/633d8e127822a72acc8879361015d116c97fa1d6.jpg"},{"name":"The First 250","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841980/05909c35bcd212a765fd63cf656969e2482a60f3.jpg"},{"name":"The First 500","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841980/464c721c6b005c344754c105059f972e626bd20c.jpg"},{"name":"Medical Officer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841980/4d86305dd21e83f8efd89e7385d13414d594ea3f.jpg"},{"name":"Combat Medical Technician Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841980/93482556f958706ab2509c57aac32c2c3e629a8d.jpg"},{"name":"Combat Medical Technician Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841980/30ce8b15d75a808c2d64cc2a9d82fb1deea95801.jpg"},{"name":"Combat Engineer Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841980/4d86305dd21e83f8efd89e7385d13414d594ea3f.jpg"},{"name":"Combat Engineer Level 2","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841980/93482556f958706ab2509c57aac32c2c3e629a8d.jpg"},{"name":"Combat Engineer Level 3","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841980/30ce8b15d75a808c2d64cc2a9d82fb1deea95801.jpg"},{"name":"Weapons Specialist Level 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3841980/4d86305dd21e83f8efd89e7385d13414d594ea3f.jpg"}],"total":18},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841980?t=1755687922","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3841980?t=1755687922","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841980/31e209a11d5abf04db4ef17b5b4c7df5ee1bf160/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755687922","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841980/31e209a11d5abf04db4ef17b5b4c7df5ee1bf160/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755687922","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now choose from 3 drones at start and enjoy more dynamic wave action!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive relentless waves of alien warbots as a customizable combat drone. Unlock weapons, deploy defensive towers mid-battle, and choose from 9 unique drone types in this fast-flowing roguelite arena shooter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 unique drones with unlockable weapons, abilities, and towers  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced, wave-based arena shooter with tower-defense strategy  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller &amp; mouse support, Steam Achievements, Cloud Saves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Works on Steam Deck and Rog Ally</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Family-friendly visuals and adjustable difficulty</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Connect with us</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join our Discord for dev chats, feedback, and future feature ideas! Follow us on X for patch news &amp; giveaways.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Year 2352, humanity is exploring the exoplanets for the expansion of its stellar empire. It comes as no surprise that we encounter alien adversaries - some easy to conquer, others far more advanced and harder to subjugate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To assist in the conquest, a dedicated fleet of fighter drones called Compadrones - or 'compadre' drones were created to serve as the ultimate vanguard of our attack forces.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compadrone: Land wars is a family friendly top down roguelite arena shooter with elements of tower defense game play in which you play as a drone sent to fight off aliens on an exoplanet.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The objective of the game is to survive against hordes of invading aliens. Use an Xbox controller or mouse to maneuver your drone across an alien landscape while shooting alien warbots, gaining experience and collecting resources and powerups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841980/extras/4f6ca6c8b3baa76abdb04da16d8e4e95.avif?t=1755687922\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game allows you to choose between 9 different types of drones, and features multiple types of aliens. The weapons on your drone fire automatically when aliens come within their range. As you progress through the game, you gain XP that can be used to unlock more advanced drones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841980/extras/f36d2d8c5229cd82c22b5d3e699e02fd.avif?t=1755687922\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy attacks come in waves, with each wave lasting between 1 to 3 minutes. At the end of each wave you can use the resources you have collected to unlock better weapons for the next wave.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841980/extras/2eed9e7ab5bd9129e29f74ba0d207d01.avif?t=1755687922\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, you can use the resources to buy and upgrade defensive towers during a wave. Defensive towers can be placed at strategic locations in the map to power up your fight against the aliens.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Notes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be played either with a mouse or an X-box controller. For the best experience we recommend you use an X-box controller.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resource points and XP are earned and spent whilst playing the game. There is no monetary value associated with these. These are merely constructs within the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no in-game purchases in this game.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Seam Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3841980/9825c085b6d689bd478ec6c578225b211bd15567/header.jpg?t=1755687922","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"(C) 2025 Seam Entertainment Limited. All Rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04.2 LTS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7<br></li>